    "turn_idx": 2,
    "turn_text": "You serve on two very important committees in the house with regard to the industry of agriculture and the food supply chain on appropriations and on agriculture. So this question comes as an appropriator. How do you balance the need to support the people and the economy with the growing national debt? It seems we're darned if we do and darned if we don't.",
