    "turn_text": "House Ag Chairman Colin Peterson is not opposed to spending additional funds by statements that he's made, but he also suggested that if additional funds are going to be sent toward agriculture, perhaps the agriculture committees in the Congress should have a say in how those dollars are distributed. Thoughts?",
