        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Global trade and demand issues have contributed to challenges in the current situation.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      {
        "text": "The financial sustainability of continued government support for agriculture is questionable over time.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Current conditions affecting agriculture will persist into 2021 unless changes occur.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The farm bill is a central mechanism through which federal support for agriculture is structured.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a finite limit to how long Washington can afford to sustain financial support for the industry.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Policy decisions around the farm bill reflect broader systemic weaknesses in agricultural support systems.",
